</section>
<section class="about-section">
<!-- consider sub-grids for this page -->
    <div class="about-head">  
        <h1 class="about-title full-span">About the brand </h1>
        <span class="full-span"><img src={YJP1} alt="Your Jam Plug UK" class="about-brand-logo">
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-welcome block">
        <p class="open-statement">We're connecting skater's to good people, good vibes, and good skate spots.</p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    <div class="about-mission block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width mission-title">Run by skaters, for skaters.</h2>
        <p class="mission-statement">If you're reading this, you probably -like me- find yourself looking at smooth floors and thinking: "Oooh this would be nice to skate on"...  
        </p>
        <p class="mission-statement">Hey, Skater~ Welcome to YJP.</p>
        
        <p class="mission-statement">Originally launched in 2023, Your Jam Plug UK was built with the aim of providing smooth paths to connect the scattered, and sometimes isolated, roller skaters across the UK (... soon expanding to the rest of Europe) with the hopes of establishing a togetherness that protects and grows our sports.</p>

        <p class="mission-statement">When things are curated for you, the experience is better. That's why we're becoming the central hub for skaters that answers all your questions, points you in the right direction, and gives you insight you didn't know you needed.</p>

        <p class="promise-statement">P.s. The long term goal is what every skater dreams about... Stay tuned x </p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-founder block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width founder-title">The Founder</h2>
        
        <div class="port founder-image">
            <Image src="/src/assets/Skater.Shynell.JPG" alt="Me" height={320} width={260}  />
            <span>taken by Daniel Bridle</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-me">
            <p>If you give me a good floor, music and my skates, I'll be happy for quite a while. But if you throw in good people and positive energy, I'm set for the whole weekend.
            </p>

            <p>I'm a London skater and I've paid plenty of wood, gravel and concrete tax... there was even a time I fell into the bushes, but we move~ </p>

            <p> No one asked me to build this, I just heard the peoples frustrations (along with my own) and thought of a solution. 
            </p>
            <p>-CONNECTIONS & COMMUNITY-</p>
            <p>We're so close to having a GREAT skate scene, I just want to help us get there. </p>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
            <blockquote>Spread the joy, spread the skill, watch it all thrive. <span>~ SHA.NE.RU ~</span></blockquote>
            
        </div>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-process">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width full-span block">How it works</h2>
        
        <p>When I say "we", I mean me and YOU! this site works off collaborations, connections and community.</p>

        <p><a href="">You - the event organiser, business owner or skate professional - submit your details using <a href="">the forms</a> <span>(btw it's free)</span></a></p>
        <p>OR</p>
        <p><a href="">You - the average skater - signs up to the newsletter</a></p>
        <p>AND</p>
        <p><a href="">Everyone shares the site, ensures all skaters know of this and give feedback, cause remember, this is for all of us.</a></p>

        <div class="direction-box">
            <p><a href="/submit-an-event">Submit an Event</a></p>
            <p><a href="">Submit a Group/Business</a></p>
            <p><a href="">Join the Newsletter</a></p>
        </div>
        
    </div>
    
    
    
    <!-- <span class="separation">...</span> -->
    <div class="about-support block">
        <!-- <h3 class="heading-small">How you can support</h3> -->
        <p>Engage and share.</p>

        <p>As I said before, this site stays alive with the support of the community. At the moment I'm a one-woman-band BUT the aim is to grow!</p>

        <p>So far, everything is out of my own pocket, abilities and time, so if skater's want to contribute, let me know!</p>
        
        <p>With enough interest and community collaboration, we should be able to move the sport forward.</p>
    </div>    
    <div class="block about-channels">
        <h4 class="heading-small">Our Official Channels</h4>
        <div class="channel-block">
            <div class="channel-div"> <a href="" target="_blank"><span>Instagram</span> <p>yourjamplug.uk</p></a></div>
            <div class="channel-div"> <a href="" target="_blank"><span>Tiktok</span> <p>Skaters.jam.plug</p></a></div>
            <div class="channel-div"> <a href="" target="_blank"><span>Discord</span> <p>Roller Skater's Jam Plug</p></a></div>
        </div>
        

    </div>
    <div class="about-process-graphic block">
        <div class="heading-full-width port process-graphic"></div>
    </div>

    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>

    .heading-full-width {
        width: 100%;
        height: max-content;

        line-height: 3ch;
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-mid);
        padding-left: .5rem;
        margin: .5rem 1rem;

    }

    .heading-small {
        width: 100%;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        justify-self: center;
    }

    .about-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        margin-top: 4rem;

    }

    .block {
        margin-block: 1.8rem;
        padding-inline: .5rem;
    }

    .separation {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--mid-teal);
    }

    .about-head {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .about-title {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        margin: .3ch;
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    .about-brand-logo {
        width: 100px;
        height: max-content;
        justify-items: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .about-welcome {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about-welcome .open-statement {
        padding-inline: 10vw;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        text-align: center;

    }

    .about-mission {
        padding: .2rem;
    }

    .about-mission .mission-title {
        text-align: right;
        justify-self: end;
        padding-right: 3rem;
    }
    .about-mission .mission-statement {
        text-align: right;
        justify-self: end;
        width: 55ch;
        padding-right: 1rem;
    }

    .direction-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 40px;
    }

    .direction-box p {
        width: 15ch;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: var(--main-orange);
        padding: 2ch 2.5ch;
        border-radius: 8px;
        justify-self: center;

        transition: all .4s ease-in-out;
    }

    .direction-box p:hover {
        scale: 1.1;
        cursor: pointer;
        background-color: var(--grey-teal);
    }



    .about-founder {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 30px 25% 20% 30px 20% 25% 30px;
        grid-template-rows: repeat(auto ) 3;

    }

    @media (max-width: 749px) {
        .direction-box{
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .about-founder {
            display:flex;
            flex-direction: column;

            align-items: center;
            justify-items: center;
        }

        .founder-title {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .founder-image {
            margin-block: 1rem;
        }

        .about-me {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        
    }

    .founder-title {
        grid-row: 1 ;
        grid-column: 1 / 5;
    }

    .founder-image {

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;

        height: 320px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        grid-row: 2;
        grid-column-end: 7;
        justify-self: end;
        
    }

    .about-me {
        grid-row: 2 /4;
        grid-column: 2 / 5;

        text-wrap: balance;

    }

    .quote {
        grid-row: 4 / 5;
        grid-column: 4 / 7;
        text-align: right;
    }

    .about-process {
        text-align: center;
        justify-items: center;
        align-self: center;
        width: 80ch;
    }
    
    .about-process-graphic {
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .process-graphic {
        width: 80%;
        justify-self: center;
        height: 110px;

        background-color: var(--main-orange);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .about-support {
        /* margin-inline: 5rem; */
        /* margin-block: 3rem; */
        width: 65ch;
        align-self: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .channel-block {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;

        
    }

    @media (max-width: 750px) {
        .channel-block {
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;

        }

        .channel-div {
            width:34ch;

        }
    }

    .channel-div {
        border: 1.5px solid var(--shadow-pink-3);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.5rem  .5rem ;
        text-align: center;

        transition: all .4s ease-in-out;
    }

    .channel-div:hover {
        scale: 1.1;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
</style>